# Local iOS signing identity (per-machine, never shared)
# Glob, not the bare name: a hand-made copy like signing.local.env.bak was NOT covered by the
# exact match and showed up as untracked, one `git add -A` away from publishing the identity.
ios/signing.local.env*

# GeneralsX: Operator-specific hosts, never committed.
# GeneralsX: Glob, for the same reason spelled out for the signing
# identity twelve lines up - and this file had already grown the exact copy that comment predicts.
# a backup copy of scripts/test/local.env held host addresses, was untracked but
# NOT ignored, and this repository is intended to go public. A bare name only covers the file
# somebody remembered to name.
scripts/test/local.env*
# ...but the template is the file that tells a newcomer which names to set, so it is exempt. It
# survives today only because it is already tracked and git does not apply ignore rules to tracked
# paths; that is luck, not intent, and it would disappear from a fresh clone the moment anyone
# untracked it. Say so explicitly instead.
!scripts/test/local.env.example
build/macos-vulkan/.verified-ref
.publish-deny
ios/project.yml.bak*
dist/launcher/
# Cargo build output for the Tauri launcher. Not ignored until 23/08/2026, which meant the first
# `cargo test -p gxio` in a fresh worktree left ~1 GB of untracked build artefacts one `git add -A`
# away from the index - the same failure mode the local.env note twenty lines up describes.
scripts/launcher-rs/target/

# GeneralsX @tooling /09/2026 The admin panel's map previews. scripts/tooling/map-previews.py
# extracts these from a local game install as a DEPLOY step (see tools/admin/panel/README.md); they
# are EA's artwork and this repository is intended to go public, so they are never committed. A fresh
# clone has none, and the panel draws its letter tile instead - which is also what a custom map does.
tools/admin/panel/public/maps/

# GeneralsX 23/09/2026 sign-ins and bot keys are bearer credentials - never commit one
GXLogin*.txt
*.gxbot
*.key

# Generated from the Community Patch archive by scripts/tooling/make-weapon-ini.py; never commit it.
# (A deploy whose runtime folder is this checkout's GeneralsZH/ writes it here.)
GeneralsZH/Data/INI/Weapon.ini
GeneralsZH/Data/INI/ObjectCreationList.ini
GeneralsZH/Data/INI/ParticleSystem.ini
GeneralsZH/Data/INI/Object/Shared/Weapon/SupW_AuroraFuelAirBomb.ini
GeneralsZH/Data/INI/Object/Shared/Weapon/SupW_AuroraFuelAirGas.ini

# GeneralsX @tooling /10/2026 The admin panel's IPv4 -> country table. scripts/tooling/geoip-country.py builds it
# at DEPLOY time from DB-IP's monthly file, pinned by URL and sha256; regenerated, never committed.
tools/admin/panel/public/geo/
